
Protect the environment: We can protect the environment in many simple ways. First, we should use clean energy like solar power or wind power to make the air cleaner. Second, we need to plant more trees because trees can give us fresh air. Third, we should reduce plastic, rubbish and waste by reusing and recycling. These actions are very small, but they can bring big changes. In my opinion, protecting the environment is very important for our life and for the next generations.


Studying is very important in our life. It helps us get more knowledge and understand the world better. When we study, we can improve our skills and learn many useful things for the future. Studying also gives us more chances to find good jobs and have a better life. In my opinion, learning is not always easy, but it is very valuable and meaningful.


Jobs are very important in our life. Having a good job helps us earn money and take care of our family. A job also gives us experience and skills, so we can improve ourselves day by day. Besides, working makes life more meaningful because we can meet people and join many activities. In my opinion, finding a suitable job is not always easy, but it is necessary for a happy life.


Modern life (positive) is becoming more and more popular today. It brings many benefits to people. For example, new technology makes communication faster and easier. Modern transport helps us move quickly between places. Modern life also makes studying and working easier because we can save a lot of time. In my opinion, modern life is very useful and brings many good opportunities for everyone.
(Negative) However, but it also causes some problems. For example, people can feel stressed because of too much work or study. Modern technology sometimes makes people lazy and spend too much time on phones or computers. Modern life can also reduce time for family and friends. In my opinion, modern life is useful, but people should be careful and use it in a smart way.


Cooperation is very important in our life. When people work together, they can finish tasks faster and better. Teamwork also helps us share ideas and learn from each other. By cooperating with others, we can solve problems more easily and achieve common goals. In my opinion, good cooperation makes life and work more successful and enjoyable.
(Negative) Cooperation is very important, but sometimes it can cause problems. For example, if people do not work well together, tasks can be delayed and mistakes can happen. Poor teamwork can also make people feel stressed or tired. In my opinion, teamwork is useful, but we should communicate and cooperate carefully to avoid problems.


✅ Mẫu: Crowd effect / Peer influence (positive)

> The crowd effect can be positive in some situations. For example, when people see others doing something good, they may want to do the same. It can help us follow rules, work together, or participate in helpful activities. In my opinion, the crowd effect is useful when it encourages people to do good things.

(negative)
> The crowd effect can also be negative. Sometimes, people follow others without thinking carefully, which can cause mistakes or problems. For example, some people may join bad habits or make wrong decisions because of others. In my opinion, we should be careful and think for ourselves, even when many people are doing the same thing.



✅ Technology (positive)
Technology is very useful in our daily lives. It gives us online classes and a lot of information on the internet, so we study better. At work, technology makes tasks faster and easier, and people save time. It also helps us communicate with family and friends anywhere in the world. In addition, technology supports health with smart devices and modern medicine. It gives us fun through movies, music, and games. In the future, technology will be more important because it will make lives more convenient, modern, and interesting.

❌ Technology (negative)
Technology also brings some problems. Many people spend too much time on phones or computers, and this makes them lazy. It causes health problems like eye strain or stress. Sometimes, people forget real communication because they use social media too much. In the future, technology will still be helpful, but we will need to use it carefully.

